			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">March 16, 2003 <strong>Rallos Zek sleeps with the fishes</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=73"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=73&a=4"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">read'em and weep. SA gains access to the elemental planes.</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=4">Jarone</a> <small>1:43am est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">January 30, 2003 <strong>Just a little update!</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=72"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=72&a=9"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">The Alliance has managed to push foward into PoP these past few weeks. Completed the HoH trials, Bertox, Saryrn, Agnarr, and last nigt MM. Congrats to all in the Alliance on a job well done!</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=9">Farkas</a> <small>9:00am est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">December 17, 2002 <strong>Ring of Vulak'Aerr Completed!</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=71"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=71&a=9"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">Another first on E'ci! Congrats to all in the Alliance.</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=9">Farkas</a> <small>1:34am est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">October 19, 2002 <strong>Semvarin looses his mind</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=70"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=70&a=111"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">As apparent in his BearsCowboys post, Semvarin has lost his mind. Everyone knows that the Bears suck. Sem will be returning to his mental hospital soon so you shouldn't have to see his ramblings in the near future.</font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td><td><p align="right"><font face="Arial"><small>--<a href="profile.php3?id=111">Gruleb</a> <small>9:12am est</small></small><br>
			    </font></td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial"><img src="images/spacer.gif" width="440"
			    height="16"></font></td>
			  </tr>
			</table>
					<table border="0" cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			  <tr>
			    <td bgColor="#000000" width="100%" colspan="2"><table border="0" cellPadding="2"
			    cellSpacing="0" width="100%">
			      <tr>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><small><font face="Arial">October 18, 2002 <strong>Bears > Cowboys</strong></font></small></td>
			        <td background="images/mt_bg.gif" bgColor="#FFCC00"><font face="Arial"><strong><p
			        align="right"><a href="news.php3?command=EDIT&id=69"><img src="images/edit_button.gif" alt="Edit this stroy" WIDTH="21" HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a><a href="delete_news.php3?id=69&a=131"><img src="images/delete_button.gif" alt="Delete this story" WIDTH="21"
			        HEIGHT="17" border="0"></a></strong></font></td>
			      </tr>
			    </table>
			    </td>
			  </tr>
			  <tr>
			    <td width="100%" colspan="2"><font face="Arial">Yes its true, the monsters of the Midway are superior to the Dallas Cowbows.  I will however say that Dallas has better cheerleaders then the Bears, and that's half the battle.<br>
<br>
(* This is one drunk's opinion *)</font></td>
			  </tr>
